Cell["\<\
We have to choose MV with real coefficients (real numbers). Otherwise in the \
end result pseudoscalar will mix with imaginary number and we can\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]t make comparison with computations using matrix \
representation\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.949373728698826*^9, 
  3.949373766519371*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a8e3179b-e6f0-437c-94a8-\
