 "6) Decomposition of square of A : ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["A", "TI"], "2"], "\[LongEqual]", 
